{"id": "lab3", "script": "Now that the figure is fixed, we count its total area in two different ways and equate them. First, the outside square has area (a + b)². The four triangles each have area one half ab, so together they have 4 times one half ab, which is 2ab. The same outside square also consists of those four triangles plus the central square, giving (a + b)² = 2ab + c². To reveal the central square's area, expand the left side: a² + 2ab + b² = 2ab + c². To remove the matching 2ab areas, subtract 2ab from both sides: a² + b² = c². So the geometry proves Pythagoras' theorem for every right-angled triangle.", "spec": {"v": 1, "heading": "Count the Same Area Two Ways", "notes": [{"id": "say-1", "text": "Count the same area two ways", "s": 0}, {"id": "say-2", "text": "(a + b)²", "s": 1}, {"id": "say-6", "text": "subtract 2ab", "s": 5}], "stage": {"kind": "equation", "tokens": [{"id": "central-square", "text": "central square", "tex": "\\text{central square}", "color": "#7c3aed"}, {"id": "outside-area", "text": "(a + b)²", "tex": "(a+b)^2", "color": "#0f766e"}, {"id": "four-triangles", "text": "4 × ½ab", "tex": "4\\times\\frac{1}{2}ab", "color": "#b45309"}, {"id": "two-ab", "text": "2ab", "tex": "2ab", "color": "#b45309"}, {"id": "equals-1", "text": "=", "tex": "="}, {"id": "equals-2", "text": "=", "tex": "="}, {"id": "equals-3", "text": "=", "tex": "="}, {"id": "equals-4", "text": "=", "tex": "="}, {"id": "equals-5", "text": "=", "tex": "="}, {"id": "expanded-area", "text": "a² + 2ab + b²", "tex": "a^2+2ab+b^2", "color": "#0369a1"}, {"id": "square-area", "text": "c²", "tex": "c^2", "color": "#7c3aed"}, {"id": "side-a", "text": "a", "tex": "a", "color": "#b45309"}, {"id": "side-b", "text": "b", "tex": "b", "color": "#0369a1"}, {"id": "side-c", "text": "c", "tex": "c", "color": "#0f766e"}, {"id": "vertex-a", "text": "a", "tex": "a", "color": "#0f766e"}, {"id": "vertex-b", "text": "b", "tex": "b", "color": "#be123c"}, {"id": "vertex-c", "text": "c", "tex": "c", "color": "#7c3aed"}, {"id": "plus-1", "text": "+", "tex": "+"}, {"id": "plus-2", "text": "+", "tex": "+"}, {"id": "plus-3", "text": "+", "tex": "+"}, {"id": "plus-4", "text": "+", "tex": "+"}, {"id": "minus-1", "text": "−", "tex": "-"}, {"id": "half-ab", "text": "½ab", "tex": "\\frac{1}{2}ab", "color": "#b45309"}, {"id": "a-squared", "text": "a²", "tex": "a^2", "color": "#b45309"}, {"id": "b-squared", "text": "b²", "tex": "b^2", "color": "#0369a1"}, {"id": "said-line-4-0-0", "text": "(a + b)²", "tex": "(a + b)^{2}"}, {"id": "said-line-4-0-1", "text": "=", "tex": "="}, {"id": "said-line-4-0-2", "text": "a²", "tex": "a^{2}"}, {"id": "said-line-4-0-3", "text": "+", "tex": "+"}, {"id": "said-line-4-0-4", "text": "2ab", "tex": "2\\text{ab}"}, {"id": "said-line-4-0-5", "text": "+", "tex": "+"}, {"id": "said-line-4-0-6", "text": "b²", "tex": "b^{2}"}, {"id": "said-line-4-0-sep", "text": ",", "tex": ",\\quad"}, {"id": "said-line-5-1-0", "text": "a²", "tex": "a^{2}"}, {"id": "said-line-5-1-1", "text": "+", "tex": "+"}, {"id": "said-line-5-1-2", "text": "2ab", "tex": "2\\text{ab}"}, {"id": "said-line-5-1-3", "text": "+", "tex": "+"}, {"id": "said-line-5-1-4", "text": "b²", "tex": "b^{2}"}, {"id": "said-line-5-1-5", "text": "−", "tex": "-"}, {"id": "said-line-5-1-6", "text": "2ab", "tex": "2\\text{ab}"}, {"id": "said-line-5-1-7", "text": "=", "tex": "="}, {"id": "said-line-5-1-8", "text": "2ab", "tex": "2\\text{ab}"}, {"id": "said-line-5-1-9", "text": "+", "tex": "+"}, {"id": "said-line-5-1-10", "text": "c²", "tex": "c^{2}"}, {"id": "said-line-5-1-11", "text": "−", "tex": "-"}, {"id": "said-line-5-1-12", "text": "2ab", "tex": "2\\text{ab}"}, {"id": "said-line-5-1-sep", "text": ",", "tex": ",\\quad"}], "steps": [{"s": 1, "order": ["outside-area"], "highlight": ["outside-area"], "caption": "Outside square area"}, {"s": 2, "order": ["four-triangles", "equals-1", "two-ab"], "highlight": ["four-triangles", "two-ab"], "caption": "Four triangles: 4 × ½ab = 2ab"}, {"s": 3, "order": ["ou